<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson wins 200 mln skr Uruguay order.</title>
<headline>Ericsson wins 200 mln skr Uruguay order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecommunications group AB LM Ericsson said on Tuesday it had won a contract worth 200 million crowns ($28.8 million) for its DRA radio access system in Montevideo from the public telecoms operator of Uruguay.</p>
<p>($ = 6.936 Swedish Crowns)</p>
</text>
